Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,1號站台的乘客請注意 電車即將通過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,請退到黃線後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:22.22,pm1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,500)\blur2}下一個影片
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想記住發生在自己身上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能是你 也可能不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但我一直都在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,「我親愛的兄弟」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果借用她的話語 大概就是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,說到底 我覺得她才是主角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最後都在故事中心的就是主角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我只不過是個旁白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才想要講述一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.83,0:02:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也許會讓人難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我還是會毫無保留地全盤托出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在能說的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,確實發生過奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也有過超越了傳說的傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:42.22,zhu,,0,0,0,,精靈機想曲 伏格爾騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.39,zhu,,0,0,0,,精靈機想曲 伏格爾騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這週的還沒出嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,請等一下 一個人去太亂來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,對付那種傢伙 我和伏格爾騎士就足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.57,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(736,662)}Vogel Chevalier
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等 等…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:02.00,pm2,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\frz10.8\pos(686,332)\blur0.5}汝之所求為何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:02.09,pm2,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\frz10.8\pos(686,332)\blur0.5\c&H86855F&}汝之所求為何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:02.71,pm2,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\frz10.8\pos(686,332)\blur0.5\c&HA86E59&}汝之所求為何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:03.55,pm3,,0,0,0,,{\frz8.821\fax0.15\pos(324,178)}無法逃離此處
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,她到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,卡隆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,卡隆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真強
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人也很喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,賽蕾基雅·優皮提莉亞閣下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你還沒有正確理解我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就讓你見識一下我的森羅萬象的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:18.68,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,662)}Holopsicon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.93,0:05:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能夠理解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,森羅萬象是萬有之力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是萬物流轉 真界轉生之力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,能將塵埃化為綠葉 讓綠葉歸於塵埃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,於是 世界將再一次回歸原點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就算沒有伏格爾騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你 快趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,颯太
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.19,Default-2,,0,0,0,,媽媽 你在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:55.37,Default-2,,0,0,0,,剛才你房裡好大動靜啊 在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.02,Default-2,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:01.23,Default-2,,0,0,0,,有什麼事可以和媽媽商量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:06.23,Default-2,,0,0,0,,別老亂塗亂畫的 學習也得加把勁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,果然在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,颯太 別太吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是同伴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是她的同伴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,賽 賽蕾基雅·優皮提莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼會知道我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,卡隆在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,敵人的波動詠唱根本沒有這樣的傳送能力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那個壞掉的機器是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,水篠 我叫水篠颯太
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,把我送回美利亞大陸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:27.23,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,662)}Earthmelia
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美 美利亞大陸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伏格爾騎士的舞台啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,賽 賽蕾基雅小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這真的跟我沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在看動畫 這是這季度最有趣的動畫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 第三集中和重機鐵塊的打鬥非常精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,重機鐵塊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你是說艾森騎士吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.26,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(684,662)}Eisen Cavalier
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:09:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那時候應該只有我和卡隆還有艾森騎士在場才對
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,波動詠唱居然有這種遠視能力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我從沒聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼你會知道這些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你是 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看的動畫的角色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,請你看一下設定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這個 就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這個故事當中的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,原作 我還有原作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我讀給你聽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,感 感到迷茫就看我的後背吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然後我的後背就交給你保護了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是卡隆對我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼你會知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,還有這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,伏格爾騎士人氣很高的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,動畫和原作都非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,機體和人物也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也 我也想有朝一日能創作出這樣的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 我沒有騙你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伏格爾騎士非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 你冷靜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在如此混亂的狀況下居然能保持冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是「精靈機想曲 伏格爾騎士」的賽蕾基雅·優皮提莉亞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字就是你追尋的答案嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快點回答
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓦隆軍團的魔導士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.97,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(552,662)}Avalon Brigade
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓦隆軍團？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這是你的世界中與你們戰鬥的敵對勢力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我並不是阿瓦隆軍團之人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這個世界也不存在阿瓦隆軍團
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且最重要的一點是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這並不是你的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但你竟然會出現在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是緣分啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,賽蕾基雅閣下 你想知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,讓你出現在這個世界的不是別人 正是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:12:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是我在召喚你 讓你出現在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎來到享樂的眾神居住的可怕世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是為了你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的我會慢慢告訴你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不認為你能成為我們的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼你會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,冷笑著說話的人根本無法信賴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看來現在我們需要對話了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要掉 要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.91,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,試駕當天就BTI 咚地一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.65,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,662)}B T I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,MDY
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:04.16,zhu2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}M D Y
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,賽 賽蕾基雅小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,坐上來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,顫抖(((({\fsp-10};゜Д{\fsp0}゜)))
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你會開車嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,比操控伏格爾騎士要簡單多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大概？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 這就是武器吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,請拐到那邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊有什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,聽我的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.33,0:14:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你的傷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是 謝謝你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我有很多事想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,關於她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,都 都說了不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是她的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.23,0:14:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 她好像認識你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把你知道的事全都告訴我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是緣分啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:14:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,請不要給我添麻煩啊 賽蕾基雅閣下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「要是我贏了 你就要任我擺佈」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是要這麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我討厭這種單調的交易
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你若是非要按這種套路來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就配合你一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真是讓人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 剛才似乎有很大的響聲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 空中好像有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,無人機？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.33,0:15:47.33,zhu,,0,0,0,,代代木上空出現不明飛行物？ 警方呼籲周邊居民提高警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,回答我 這是哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是神明的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,賽蕾基雅閣下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你少胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,胡說八道？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為我在開玩笑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,毫無疑問 這裡就是神代之地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,到處都是不負責的造物主 是個可怕的異世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就會懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的話中之意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我們將在這個世界發起變革
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,制裁神明之地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,美特歐拉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你還沒找到自己的造物主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,雖說你我都是穿越至此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但我們沒有力量 棋子也不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然動亂是我所願
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是演奏者不夠 交響樂也會雜亂無章
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,只有演奏者到齊了 才能奏出恢弘的樂章
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我們還會再見的 賽蕾基雅閣下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為了取代這個骯髒的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我將盛情款待你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你也和我一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也是來自另一個世界嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她說的都是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一切的開始是如此荒誕又突然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.64,pm4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(692,550)\frz351.5\fax0.2}代代木公園附近發生神秘爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那個夢轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很快便會消失在安穩的日常之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾這樣認為
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:18:59.40,zhu,,0,0,0,,代代木公園發生神秘爆炸？原因尚未查明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這世上的麻煩事都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦開始 就無法停下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.86,pm5,,0,0,0,,{\frz355.7\pos(770,222)\c&H7D7075&}現場報導：代代木附近發生神秘爆炸 原因尚未查明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.86,pm5,,0,0,0,,{\frz349.1\fax0.15\fs25\pos(278,412)\c&H555858&}好可怕！但我也好想看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.86,pm5,,0,0,0,,{\frz346.2\fax0.15\fs25\pos(274,562)}房頂都被毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:03.20,zhu,,0,0,0,,爆炸什麼的無所謂啦 快貼幾張coser的照片啊 我不會亂用的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:07.16,pm6,,0,0,0,,今早的新聞看了嗎？\N是代代木吧\N什麼新聞？\N代代木發生爆炸了\N好像還有人在飛\N爆炸？那可不妙啊\N好像還飛來飛去的 可能是UFO\N貌似不是 現場好像有人在cosplay\N是在搞活動嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:08.37,zhu,,0,0,0,,我去趟立川再回家 你晚飯在外面解決吧 媽媽留
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,發出一聲響動 世界就此改變
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只需一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,便足以改變世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:28.06,biaoti,,0,0,0,,絕 妙 的 航 海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.83,zhu,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:52.85,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}交わる時間上にない涙腺曲がる快楽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:56.40,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}吐き捨てる哀・怒を手に妬みとつないでる
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:20:01.06,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}映り気にしてる程見えない相違
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:05.48,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}価値観の連鎖を止めるフリー気取りの×
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:12.44,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}gravity-wall　{\fsp5}口づけを
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:16.52,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I'm screaming something to you. Whatever, something to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:20.64,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}ズレた答えをどけた先だけが
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:24.97,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I'm screaming something to you. Whatever, something to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:29.07,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}絡まってる裸足でも賭ける
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:32.44,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Now I don't know what I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:37.80,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I still don't know how to escape from this beautiful trap
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:40.64,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Don't know what I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:46.54,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}I still don't know how to escape from this dangerous trap
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.74,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Break your stereo days
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:56.27,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}空ほどいた太陽と羽の白が
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:59.05,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Brave invisible world
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:03.13,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}無くした色たちを照らす
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.26,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Break your stereo days
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:12.71,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Whatever they say, you'll never stop to believe in yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.48,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Brave invisible world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:20.75,op-en,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}You know that it's true. You can find the new way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,op-cn,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:52.85,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}時間交錯 那催人淚下的快樂卻無處可尋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:56.40,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}捨棄哀·怒 緊握手中 與嫉妒相連
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:20:01.06,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}若隱若現的差異 令人在意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:05.48,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}那自由的× 斬斷價值觀的連鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:12.44,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}輕吻那重力之牆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:16.52,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我呼喊著你 不惜一切
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:20.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}只為追尋正確答案
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:24.97,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我呼喊著你 不惜一切
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:29.07,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}甚至賭上那步履蹣跚的雙足
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:32.44,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我不知何為所求
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:37.80,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}亦不知如何逃離這美麗陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:40.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}我不知何為所求
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:46.54,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}亦不知如何逃離這危險陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.74,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}打破你的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:56.27,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}光羽輝映成純白 浸染天空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:59.05,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}宏偉的虛擬世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:03.13,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}照亮失落的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.26,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}打破你的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:12.71,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}無所顧忌 永遠相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:15.48,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}宏偉的虛擬世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:20.75,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}正誤分明 你能找到新道路
